The ffmpeg.yml, libx264.yml and libvpx.yml recipes are adapted from:
https://github.com/leleliu008/xcpkg-formula-repository-official-core
Commit: 8d65dc3e03a9fd8e681003ea19163172c7f4c78f
License: Apache-2.0 (APACHE-2.0.txt)

Changes pin FFmpeg 8.1.1 and x264 source archives, enable the selected codecs,
use SDL2's configure option, support cross-compiling, and avoid rebuilding
twice during installation. The libvpx recipe selects the target macOS ABI
explicitly so host detection cannot choose Linux linker flags. The x264
recipe uses NASM for Intel assembly and Clang for ARM assembly.
